## Security Controls by AWS Service

| Control | AWS Service | Implementation |
|---------|-------------|----------------|
| **Encryption at Rest** | KMS + RDS/S3 | AWS-managed KMS key |
| **Encryption in Transit** | TLS | HTTPS everywhere |
| **Authentication** | Cognito | JWT + MFA |
| **Authorization** | IAM + Cognito Groups | IAM roles + Cognito claims |
| **Rate Limiting** | WAF | Rate-based rules |
| **SQL Injection Protection** | WAF + Parameterized Queries | WAF + Prisma/ORM |
| **XSS Protection** | WAF + CSP | WAF + Helmet.js |
| **Secrets Rotation** | Secrets Manager | Automatic rotation |
| **Audit Logging** | CloudTrail + CloudWatch | All API calls logged |
| **Threat Detection** | GuardDuty | Intelligent threat detection |
| **Backup** | RDS Snapshots + S3 Lifecycle | Automated backups |
| **DDoS Protection** | Shield Standard + WAF | Always-on DDoS |
| **Vulnerability Scanning** | Inspector | EC2/container scanning |
| **Network Isolation** | VPC + Private Subnets | No public internet access |
